{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/extras/zone_small_capsule.png?t=1743722209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zone is a turn-based military strategy game inspired by Advance Wars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can capture key strategic locations, reinforce your army and outmaneuver your enemies on land, sea and in the skies. Conquer the challenging single-player campaign or fight other players in LAN multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zone also allows for multiple-players-one-device games and includes a level editor and numerous customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/extras/attackcommand.png?t=1743722209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each turn, you can command your forces to move on a grid-patterned battlefield and attack an enemy unit that is in range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies can be hiding in shrouded forest terrain or in the fog of war. It is up to you to lead your army forward to find and eliminate all enemy combatants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/extras/capture.png?t=1743722209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your units can capture cities and factories they find in the war zone. These building resupply and reinforce your army and allow you to construct additional units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/extras/zone_library_hero_2.png?t=1743722209\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607460?t=1743722209","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607460?t=1743722209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/9d173c59901ec37790a96014df12a11fc24dd27e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743722209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/9d173c59901ec37790a96014df12a11fc24dd27e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743722209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/extras/zone_small_capsule.png?t=1743722209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zone is a turn-based military strategy game inspired by Advance Wars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can capture key strategic locations, reinforce your army and outmaneuver your enemies on land, sea and in the skies. Conquer the challenging single-player campaign or fight other players in LAN multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zone also allows for multiple-players-one-device games and includes a level editor and numerous customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/extras/attackcommand.png?t=1743722209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each turn, you can command your forces to move on a grid-patterned battlefield and attack an enemy unit that is in range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies can be hiding in shrouded forest terrain or in the fog of war. It is up to you to lead your army forward to find and eliminate all enemy combatants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/extras/capture.png?t=1743722209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your units can capture cities and factories they find in the war zone. These building resupply and reinforce your army and allow you to construct additional units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/extras/zone_library_hero_2.png?t=1743722209\" /></p>","developers":["Kirill Gratchev"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607460/07fe3d7ff93fdb2deda38678860dc9c53849ae3e/header.jpg?t=1743722209","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118791,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118791/movie480.mp4?t=1743722207","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118791/movie_max.mp4?t=1743722207"},"name":"Zone","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118791/f7393439e63dcd0b56bdfb5a0003120f17bbecfb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743722207","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118791/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743722207","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118791/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743722207"}}],"name":"Zone","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> -<br></li><li><st